From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 23:03:20 -0400
Subject: Translator: Apply loop-forward-progress transform to PowerVR

The transformation already existed for MSL.  For PowerVR (ESSL),
`volatile` cannot be used, so a different forward progress guarantee is
implemented; a variable that is incremented and the loop is broken out
of on overflow which practically never happens.

Bug: chromium:569191970
Change-Id: Ide392418a752127dde69375e553fd32c5f0455cf
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8593361
Reviewed-by: Yuxin Hu <yuxinhu@google.com>
Commit-Queue: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Auto-Submit: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>

Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y):
compiler.gni / Compiler.cpp / ir/BUILD.gn / transform.rs context resolved
(ExpandFragmentOutputsToVec4 is not on this branch).

